        ":question/problem": "Find $(A+B)-C-(B-C)$, if\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 9 \\\\ 3 & 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,B=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,C=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 2 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$",
